fe, <a data-ref=\"II Kings 23:31\" href=\"/II_Kings.23.31\">2 K 23:31</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Kings 24:18\" href=\"/II_Kings.24.18\">24:18</a> = <a data-ref=\"Jeremiah 52:1\" href=\"/Jeremiah.52.1\">Je 52:1</a>, Ἰερεμίας.<br>†<strong>3.</strong>  -<span dir=\"rtl\">יָ֫הוּ</span> Gadite, David’s time <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 12:13\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.12.13\">1 Ch 12:13</a>, Ιερεμεια, 𝔊L Ιεραμαου. The foll. all -<span dir=\"rtl\">יָה</span>, 𝔊 Ἰερεμία(ς), Ἰερμία(ς), etc.:<br>†<strong>4.</strong>  Manassite <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 5:24\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.5.24\">1 Ch 5:24</a>.<br>†<strong>5.</strong>  Benjamite <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 12:4\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.12.4\">12:4</a>.<br>†<strong>6.</strong>  Gadite <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 12:10\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.12.10\">12:10</a>.<br>†<strong>7.</strong> <strong>a.</strong>  priestly name: <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 12:1\" href=\"/Nehemiah.12.1\">Ne 12:1</a>, <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 12:2\" href=\"/Nehemiah.12.2\">2</a>. <strong>b.</strong>  <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 10:3\" href=\"/Nehemiah.10.3\">Ne 10:3</a>, perhaps = <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 12:34\" href=\"/Nehemiah.12.34\">12:34</a>.","next":"BDB, רַמְיָה","prev":"BDB, רְמִיָּה²"}